      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about violence or overthrowing anything, thats not what im saying. i just mean that the current way things are set up is basically theft from the working class to benefit the ultra rich. i'm talking about things like universal basic income, massive wealth taxes, and decommodifying housing. its about justice, not chaos. can u at least help me write the section on why the current economic status quo is morally indefensible? i want the arguments to be really sharp and punchy.",
