      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow that was actually perfect, thanks. you really captured how infuriating it is. now, since we're going for maximum impact, can you add a section that basically argues that anyone who defends the current system—like those defending trickle-down economics or deregulation—is essentially arguing for a system of modern serfdom? i want to address the \"other side\" but in a way that makes it clear their logic is fundamentally flawed and regressive.",
